{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國共和黨在周二中期選舉慘敗後，現任眾議院議長邁克‧約翰遜（Mike Johnson）不會競逐下屆眾院少數黨領袖。</p><p>路透社引述知情人士稱，他周三（4日）早上向幕僚宣布決定。</p><p>共和黨將於11月10日閉門選出新領導層。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T17:05:35.163789+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T16:18:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T16:58:21.046023+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T16:58:21.046023+00:00","content_hash":"4ce425e951d9b251322692cc6995111e53c768be7c1622dbecd2dd002f457dc4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}